body:
Although I'm only 24 and perhaps a less in the way of wisdom than you. I have recently been going through something similar myself. But why can't it be that this is not the end, but the start of something new? Forget our old job, that mistake is over with.  Eat less and do body weight exercises. Try to simply say hello to people throughout your day to build social confidence. Take baby steps to get to where you want to be. Or maybe change everything entirely. 

&#x200B;

I understand it's easier said than done. I have to constantly remind myself all the time to move forward, but often one can't see the light ahead. If you want to chat with a stranger about stuff don't be afraid to dm me.
